direction: right
Sources: Source systems {shape: cylinder}
Ingest: Batch ingestion {shape: rectangle}
Landing: Raw data lake {shape: stored_data}
Validate: Data quality checks {shape: diamond}
Transform: Transformation jobs {shape: rectangle}
Warehouse: Data warehouse {shape: cylinder}
Semantic: Semantic layer {shape: rectangle}
BI: BI dashboards {shape: page}
Catalog: Data catalog {shape: document}
Sources -> Ingest
Ingest -> Landing
Landing -> Validate
Validate -> Transform: passed
Transform -> Warehouse
Warehouse -> Semantic
Semantic -> BI
Landing -> Catalog: metadata
Warehouse -> Catalog: lineage
